#*
#*   Script Name:	tp/scripts/tpWrite
#*
#*   Purpose:
#*	This script can be used to write tapes.  It is intended to be used
#*	with mediaWrite.
#*
#*   Date		: Feb 25, 1999
#*
#*   SCCS data		: @(#)
#*	Module Name	: tpWriteTar
#*	Version Number	: 1.6
#*	Release Number	: 1
