#*	99/03/17 SDJ	: Added num_files argument.
#*	99/04/09 SDJ	: Added optional -simulate command-line arg.
#*			  Device Name now composed from device_info and
#*			  "n" is always appended to the end.
#*	99/04/15 SDJ	: Changed script to use "path" to find the gnu
#*			  tar and mt applications.
#*	99/04/29 SDJ	: Added relative path support.
#*
